            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"heavier-layers-status\">Heavier layers (status)</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>layer</th>\n<th>model</th>\n<th>status</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>LightGBM, CatBoost, TabPFN v2 (+ logistic, tree, single-feature rule)</td>\n<td>working</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Chronos-Bolt small, Kronos-small: 20-minute forecast from the pre-entry window</td>\n<td>working; scores cached in <code>data/models/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>CLM-8B as an experimental gate (Q8 GGUF or 8-bit MLX)</td>\n<td>optional, not started</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Jev cross-ticker ranking</td>\n<td>needs Jero's Jev key</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Add a model: write a class with <code>fit</code>, <code>predict_proba</code>, <code>explain</code> in <code>src/spike_lab/models/zoo.py</code> and register it in <code>REGISTRY</code>.\nTorch models run in <code>torch_worker.py</code> (separate process).</span></span>"
